@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8081
@accessToken =
@adminToken =
@apiSportsKey =
@date = 2026-10-02
@soccerEventId = UUID_DEL_CATALOGO_SOCCER
@leagueId = 72
@leagueVersion = 0

### Catálogo de deportes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tracking/sports
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Partidos de ligas habilitadas (jornada UTC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tracking/events?sport=SOCCER&date={{date}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Jugadores y fotos del partido
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tracking/events/{{soccerEventId}}/players
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Seguimiento informativo de goles, 90 minutos más compensación
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tracking/bets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId":"{{soccerEventId}}","market":"PLAYER_GOALS","selection":"OVER","line":0.5,"playerId":"197038"}

### Login de administrador local (no guardar tokens en capturas)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin-demo","password":"admin-demo-change-me"}

### Ligas configuradas; lectura local sin consumir API-Football
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/mybet/soccer/leagues
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Buscar ligas (3–60 caracteres); caché de 24 horas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/mybet/soccer/search?search=Serie%20B
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Agregar resultado del proveedor (409 si ya existe)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/mybet/soccer/leagues
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":72,"enabled":true}

### Deshabilitar nuevos seguimientos y conservar existentes
# Obtener version actual con GET /soccer/leagues antes de editar.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/mybet/soccer/leagues/{{leagueId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled":false,"version":{{leagueVersion}}}

### Cuota local, no consume una consulta externa
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/mybet/provider?sport=SOCCER
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Comprobar cuenta con API-Football
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/mybet/provider/check?sport=SOCCER
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Proveedor crudo: jornada (consume cuota al ejecutarse)
GET https://v3.football.api-sports.io/fixtures?date={{date}}&timezone=UTC
x-apisports-key: {{apiSportsKey}}

### Proveedor crudo: estadísticas y fotos (consume cuota)
GET https://v3.football.api-sports.io/fixtures/players?fixture=1520908
x-apisports-key: {{apiSportsKey}}

### Proveedor crudo: status (no publicar datos de la cuenta)
GET https://v3.football.api-sports.io/status
x-apisports-key: {{apiSportsKey}}
